Package: a3-engine
Version: 0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: a3-core, pipewire-jack
Breaks: a3-core (<< 03.0+542), beat-analyzer (<< 03.0+64)
Replaces: a3-engine-bench
Conflicts: a3-engine-bench
Provides: a3-engine-bench
Description: A3 audio engine: channel strips, IEM encoders and decoders, JACK or ALSA device I/O
 The A3 program /usr/bin/a3-core: the window, the Core and the audio engine as
 roles of one binary, and the systemd user unit a3-engine.service, which runs
 its engine role without a window. It reads the OSC
 address truth from /usr/share/a3/a3-osc.json (installed by a3-core), its
 config from ~/.config/a3/engine/engine.json or /usr/share/a3-engine/engine.json,
 and the speaker layouts and IEM data from /usr/share/a3-engine/spatial.
 .
 a3-engine-bench, the headless JACK host for parity and load runs, is shipped
 as a tool.
